cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use StillMind in your research, please cite it as follows."
title: "StillMind — Agentic Memory for a Meditation Agent"
abstract: >-
  StillMind is a non-clinical lifestyle meditation coach built on CockroachDB
  as the persistent memory layer and AWS as the runtime. It demonstrates the
  agentic memory (ACM) lifecycle — architecting, ingesting, scoping,
  anticipating, compacting, checkpointing, locking, and auditing — realized as
  CockroachDB + AWS components. Submitted to the CockroachDB x AWS "Build with
  Agentic Memory" hackathon.
